IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SARATHI-CHUNK.

DATA DIVISION.
01 PROMPT-TOKENS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CHUNK-BUDGET        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 ACTIVE-DECODES      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 PREFILL-ITERS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SARATHI-CHUNK.
    IF CHUNK-BUDGET == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE PROMPT-TOKENS TO PREFILL-ITERS.
    DIVIDE CHUNK-BUDGET INTO PREFILL-ITERS.
    IF PREFILL-ITERS == 0
        MOVE 1 TO PREFILL-ITERS.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 PREFILL-ITERS.
    WEIGHT 30 ACTIVE-DECODES.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
